      "writtenOn": "2023-07-13T22:13:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "By keeping the spinlock variable in the struct and just renaming it to `unused`, we will ensure backwards compatibility for drivers that are not re-compiled with this GKI kernel. When they try to re-compile, if they are using the `dpcm_lock`, then they will get a build failure and can re-factor their OOT drivers to use the new locking logic.\n\nI think that\u0027s reasonable.",
